    {
      "id": "claim_378287f072a04458b7482923bc24f4c5",
      "statement": "Tests must never depend on external services: Redis, outbound HTTP APIs, SMTP and DNS are mocked or stubbed across the backend, and all API calls are mocked on the frontend; the ephemeral testcontainers PostgreSQL instance (or TEST_DATABASE_URL) is the only allowed infrastructure dependency, so a test that performs a real network, Redis or SMTP call is broken by definition rather than something to fix by requiring the service.",
